  "result": "Perfect! The fix is complete and all tests pass. \n\n## Summary\n\nI found and fixed a critical multi-tenancy security vulnerability in the issue repository:\n\n**The Bug:** The `findIssueById` function in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts` accepted an `orgId` parameter but never used it in the database query. This allowed users from one organization to fetch issues from any other organization by providing an issue ID directly.\n\n**The Fix:** I added the organization scope predicate to the database query:\n```typescript\n.where(and(orgPredicate(issues.orgId, orgId), eq(issues.id, issueId)))\n```\n\nThis ensures that issue lookups by ID are now properly scoped to the requesting organization. All 617 tests pass with this fix.",
